    {
      "SurveyID": "SV_82351c2d3f0f497",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID3",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "Background 1",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<p style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#667;\">Background 1 of 3</p><h2 style=\"margin-top:4px;\">The Park</h2><p>Thanks for taking part in this task.</p><p>The theme park is called Aetheria Gardens. Its entrance team’s daily work includes checking tickets at the entrance, scanning QR codes, confirming visitor categories, guiding visitors into the park, and answering simple questions from visitors.</p><p>The park is run by a management team. The operations manager is in charge of the entrance team and of how the park is staffed, and drew up the staffing plan you are asked to review.</p>",
        "QuestionType": "DB",
        "Selector": "TB",
        "Configuration": {
          "QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"
        },
        "ChoiceOrder": [],
