    {
      "SurveyID": "SV_82351c2d3f0f497",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID21",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "Materials 1",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<p style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#667;\">Materials 1 of 3</p><h2 style=\"margin-top:4px;\">Off-Season Situation</h2><p>The park also supplied material about its <strong>off-season situation</strong>. Please read it before deciding whether to send a further note.</p><p>On a typical off-season weekday, the park receives <strong>around 500 visitors</strong>.</p><p>The entrance is quiet for long periods, and staff members at the gate have <strong>relatively little work to do</strong>.</p>",
        "QuestionType": "DB",
        "Selector": "TB",
        "Configuration": {
          "QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"
        },
        "ChoiceOrder": [],
        "Validation": {
          "Settings": {
            "Type": "None"
          }
        },
        "QuestionID": "QID21",
        "DataExportTag": "materials_1",
        "QuestionDescription": "Materials 1",
        "Language": [],
        "DefaultChoices": false,
        "DataVisibility": {
          "Private": false,
          "Hidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "SurveyID": "SV_82351c2d3f0f497",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID22",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "Materials 2",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<p style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#667;\">Materials 2 of 3</p><h2 style=\"margin-top:4px;\">Visitor Pattern</h2><p>Most visitors are <strong>families with young children</strong>. Families with children under 10 account for <strong>around 70% to 75%</strong> of daily visitors, while other visitor groups make up a much smaller share.</p><p>Aetheria Gardens is <strong>far from the city center</strong>, and many families say the location is <strong>not very convenient</strong>.</p>",
        "QuestionType": "DB",
        "Selector": "TB",
        "Configuration": {
          "QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"
        },
        "ChoiceOrder": [],
        "Validation": {
          "Settings": {
            "Type": "None"
          }
        },
        "QuestionID": "QID22",
        "DataExportTag": "materials_2",
        "QuestionDescription": "Materials 2",
        "Language": [],
        "DefaultChoices": false,
        "DataVisibility": {
          "Private": false,
          "Hidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "SurveyID": "SV_82351c2d3f0f497",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID23",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "Materials 3",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<p style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#667;\">Materials 3 of 3</p><h2 style=\"margin-top:4px;\">Nearby Visitors</h2><p>There are several universities and farms <strong>near the theme park</strong>, including <strong>4 universities within 10 to 18 km</strong> and <strong>around 38,000 nearby university students</strong>.</p><p>Some university students say the park is cute, but it feels mainly <strong>designed for little kids</strong>. Others mention that <strong>student discounts</strong> or <strong>more photo-friendly spots</strong> might make the park more attractive to students.</p><p>On the next page you can send the same manager a further note about this situation if you wish.</p>",
        "QuestionType": "DB",
        "Selector": "TB",
        "Configuration": {
          "QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"
        },
        "ChoiceOrder": [],
        "Validation": {
          "Settings": {
            "Type": "None"
          }
        },
        "QuestionID": "QID23",
        "DataExportTag": "materials_3",
        "QuestionDescription": "Materials 3",
        "Language": [],
        "DefaultChoices": false,
        "DataVisibility": {
          "Private": false,
          "Hidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "SurveyID": "SV_82351c2d3f0f497",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID24",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "A further note to the manager (optional)   If you have a suggestion about the off-season situation y",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<p><strong>A further note to the manager (optional)</strong></p><p>If you have a suggestion about the off-season situation you have just read, you can send it to the same operations manager. It will be read and rated in the same way, and the rating affects your bonus in the same way. Write it below, or leave the box empty if you have nothing to add.</p>",
        "QuestionType": "TE",
        "Selector": "ESTB",
        "Configuration": {
          "QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText",
          "InputWidth": 600,
          "InputHeight": 220
        },
        "Validation": {
          "Settings": {
            "ForceResponse": "OFF",
            "Type": "None"
          }
        },
        "QuestionJS": "// Voice DV page: question JavaScript on the optional Text Entry (essay) question.\n// Records when the page opened and when it was submitted, and copies the text into \"voice_text\".\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"voice_start\", new Date().toISOString());\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnPageSubmit(function () {\n  var textarea = this.getQuestionContainer().querySelector(\"textarea\");\n  var submitted = new Date().toISOString();\n  var text = textarea ? textarea.value.trim() : \"\";\n  Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"voice_submit\", submitted);\n  Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"voice_text\", text);\n  try {\n    if (typeof Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setJSEmbeddedData === \"function\") {\n      Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setJSEmbeddedData(\"voice_submit\", submitted);\n      Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setJSEmbeddedData(\"voice_text\", text);\n    }\n  } catch (error) {}\n});\n",
        "QuestionID": "QID24",
        "DataExportTag": "voice_text_q",
        "QuestionDescription": "A further note to the manager (optional)   If you have a suggestion about the off-season situation y",
        "Language": [],
        "DefaultChoices": false,
        "DataVisibility": {
          "Private": false,
          "Hidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "SurveyID": "SV_82351c2d3f0f497",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID25",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "Survey intro",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<p><strong>Post-task questions</strong></p><p>Please answer the following questions based on your experience in this study. There are no right or wrong answers. Please indicate the extent to which you agree with each statement.</p>",
        "QuestionType": "DB",
        "Selector": "TB",
        "Configuration": {
          "QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"
        },
        "ChoiceOrder": [],
        "Validation": {
          "Settings": {
            "Type": "None"
          }
        },
        "QuestionID": "QID25",
        "DataExportTag": "survey_intro",
        "QuestionDescription": "Survey intro",
        "Language": [],
        "DefaultChoices": false,
        "DataVisibility": {
          "Private": false,
          "Hidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "SurveyID": "SV_82351c2d3f0f497",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID26",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "The following statements are about the second task, in which you could write a suggestion to the man",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<p><strong style=\"color:#c0392b;\">The following statements are about the second task, in which you could write a suggestion to the manager after reading the additional materials. Please indicate how much you agree with each statement about what you actually did.</strong></p>",
        "QuestionType": "Matrix",
        "Selector": "Likert",
        "SubSelector": "SingleAnswer",
        "Configuration": {
          "QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText",
          "TextPosition": "inline",
          "ChoiceColumnWidth": 30,
          "RepeatHeaders": "none",
          "WhiteSpace": "ON",
          "MobileFirst": true
        },
        "Choices": {
          "1": {
            "Display": "I proposed more than one specific improvement to the manager in the second task."
          },
          "2": {
            "Display": "I made a point of raising new ideas about the visitor issue with the manager."
          },
          "3": {
            "Display": "Even though the manager had turned down my earlier proposal, I still put forward my views."
          },
          "4": {
            "Display": "I used the opportunity in the second task to share my ideas proactively."
          },
          "5": {
            "Display": "I brought my own ideas into the suggestion rather than only restating what the materials said."
          },
          "6": {
            "Display": "I offered several suggestions and ideas of my own."
          }
        },
        "ChoiceOrder": [
          "1",
          "2",
          "3",
          "4",
          "5",
          "6"
        ],
        "Answers": {
          "1": {
            "Display": "1<br>Strongly disagree"
          },
          "2": {
            "Display": "2<br>Disagree"
          },
          "3": {
            "Display": "3<br>Neither agree nor disagree"
          },
          "4": {
            "Display": "4<br>Agree"
          },
          "5": {
            "Display": "5<br>Strongly agree"
          }
        },
        "AnswerOrder": [
          "1",
          "2",
          "3",
          "4",
          "5"
        ],
        "ChoiceDataExportTags": {
          "1": "VF1",
          "2": "VF2",
          "3": "VF3",
          "4": "VF4",
          "5": "VF5",
          "6": "VF6"
        },
        "Validation": {
          "Settings": {
            "ForceResponse": "ON",
            "ForceResponseType": "ON",
            "Type": "None"
          }
        },
        "NextChoiceId": 7,
        "NextAnswerId": 6,
        "QuestionID": "QID26",
        "DataExportTag": "VF",
        "QuestionDescription": "The following statements are about the second task, in which you could write a suggestion to the man",
        "Language": [],
        "DefaultChoices": false,
        "DataVisibility": {
          "Private": false,
          "Hidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "SurveyID": "SV_82351c2d3f0f497",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID27",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "Preparing your suggestion",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<p><strong>Preparing your suggestion</strong></p>",
        "QuestionType": "Matrix",
        "Selector": "Likert",
        "SubSelector": "SingleAnswer",
        "Configuration": {
          "QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText",
          "TextPosition": "inline",
          "ChoiceColumnWidth": 30,
          "RepeatHeaders": "none",
          "WhiteSpace": "ON",
          "MobileFirst": true
        },
        "Choices": {
          "1": {
            "Display": "Before writing my suggestion in the second task, I tried to back what I might suggest with the information available to me, such as the entrance records, visitor comments, or location details."
          },
          "2": {
            "Display": "Before writing my suggestion in the second task, I made an effort to think through the practical concerns a manager would have, such as visitor demand, feasibility, or park operations."
          },
          "3": {
            "Display": "Before writing my suggestion in the second task, I tried to anticipate the questions or doubts the manager might raise, and how I would answer them."
          },
          "4": {
            "Display": "Before writing my suggestion in the second task, I made an effort to work out a clear, actionable course of action rather than a general idea."
          }
        },
        "ChoiceOrder": [
